{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100804","id":2251735772,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GNsLc","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100804","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100804.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100804.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100804","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100804/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100804/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100804/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d9ebf320523ee868c60747024fbf99636013217f","number":100804,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve and fix packed arrays usage","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/77133 with some additional improvements.\r\n\r\n- [ ] ~~Add type checks to packed arrays the same way it works for typed arrays~~ WIP in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99950;\r\n- [x] Fix storing elements as typed arrays in resources when instead it should have used the packed version (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/77133);\r\n- [x] Commenting/Uncommenting `@tools` resets the packed array if it was saved as a typed array.\r\n\r\nThe approach here is to make sure in `GDScriptAnalyzer::make_variable_default_value` that the `initializer_value` is converted to the `p_variable` built in type (e.g. `Array` to `PackedVector3Array`).\r\nI feel the implementation can be improved (avoiding a new method, using a different method name, etc.), but I'll wait for a review for that.\r\n\r\nThe logic of the new code is taken from the body of `GDScriptInstance::set` for the data conversion part:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0f95e9f8e665cedaa5aace5f6f86de2b4b5a8c60/modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp#L1697C1-L1702C6\r\n\r\nBefore this commit, any packed array initialized with an empty `Array` would result in a typed `Array` being stored in the `test.tres` file.\r\n\r\n#### Minimal reproduction project\r\n[MinimalProject.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18247292/MinimalProject.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","lab